Perfect! I now have all the key files. Let me compile a comprehensive report of my findings.

## Report: About Page HTML & SCSS Analysis

### 1. **Full Section List in views/pages/about/index.php**

The about page contains the following sections (all with class `no-sub-about-section`):

| Section | Class | data-scene | aria-hidden | Line | Notes |
|---------|-------|-----------|------------|------|-------|
| Hero Intro | `no-sub-about-hero-intro` | `heroIntro` | `false` | 88 | First section, viewport height, has is-block-reveal text reveals |
| Hero Slogan | `no-sub-about-hero-slogan` | `heroSlogan` | `true` | 127 | Sticky carousel of keywords (DESIGN/DEVELOPMENT/BRANDING/UI/UX) |
| Gallery | `no-sub-about-gallery` | (none) | `true` | 175 | Canvas-based gallery with about-gallery-canvas |
| Proof | `no-sub-about-proof` | `proof` | `true` | 182 | Canvas-based section with about-proof-canvas |
| Mission/Vision | `no-sub-about-mission-vision` | `missionVision` | `true` | 188 | OUR VISION text + 3 MISSION cards (UNCHARTED/PROOF/LAUNCH) |
| Services | `no-sub-about-services` | `services` | `true` | 236 | 5 services (Web Build, App Build, Branding, UI·UX, Maintenance) |
| Awards | `no-sub-about-awards` | `awards` | `true` | 275 | Award list table with hover preview and video preview |
| Partners/Clients | `no-sub-about-client` | `client` | `true` | 358 | 22 client logos in 4-column grid |
| Contact | `no-main-contact` | `contact` | `true` | 384 | Bottom CTA section with Contact/Works buttons |

**Wrapper:** All sections (except hero-intro) are wrapped in `.no-sub-about-journey-surface` which has:
- `--about-journey-surface-alpha: 0.24`
- `background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24)`
- `backdrop-filter: blur(24px)`

**Text Reveal Classes:**
- `.is-block-reveal` — opacity/transform/filter reveal
- `.is-block-reveal-up` — state class for visible/revealed
- `.mask-target` — targets within `.is-block-reveal` elements

---

### 2. **Existing SCSS for .no-sub-about-gallery and .no-sub-about-proof**

**Gallery (lines 466–486):**
```scss
.no-sub-about-gallery {
  width: 100%;

  &__canvas-wrap {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100svh;
    overflow: hidden;
    cursor: grab;

    &:active {
      cursor: grabbing;
    }

    canvas {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
    }
  }
}
```

**Proof (lines 488–502):**
```scss
.no-sub-about-proof {
  width: 100%;

  &__canvas-wrap {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100svh;

    canvas {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
    }
  }
}
```

Both are **canvas wrappers** only — minimal styling, no animation or reveal patterns. They rely on JavaScript rendering via Three.js or similar.

---

### 3. **Text Reveal & Pin Animation Utilities in SCSS**

**Block Reveal System** (`_utils.scss`, lines 191–237):

```scss
.is-block-reveal {
  opacity: 0;
  visibility: hidden;
  transform: translate3d(0, var(--block-reveal-offset-y), 0);
  filter: blur(var(--block-reveal-blur));
  pointer-events: none;
  transition:
    opacity var(--transition-slow),
    transform var(--transition-slow),
    filter var(--duration-default) var(--ease-default),
    visibility 0s linear var(--duration-slow);
  will-change: transform, opacity, filter;
  transform-origin: 50% 100%;
  backface-visibility: hidden;

  &.is-block-reveal-up {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
    transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
    filter: blur(0);
    pointer-events: auto;
    transition-delay: 0s, 0s, 0s, 0s;
  }

  &.is-block-reveal-down {
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: visible;
    transform: translate3d(0, var(--block-reveal-offset-y), 0);
    filter: blur(var(--block-reveal-blur));
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  &.is-block-reveal-hidden,
  &.is-block-reveal-instant {
    transition: none;
  }
}
```

**Modal Enter/Exit Animations** (`_modal.scss`, lines 55–60):
```scss
transform: translate3d(0, fluid(48, 72), 0) scale(0.985);
transition:
  transform calc(var(--duration-default) + 0.04s) var(--modal-enter-ease),
  opacity calc(var(--duration-default) + 0.04s) var(--modal-enter-ease),
  filter calc(var(--duration-default) + 0.04s) var(--modal-enter-ease);
```

States: `.is-open` (translate(0,0) scale(1)), `.is-closing` (translate(0, 56-84px) scale(0.985))

**Button Highlight Sweep** (`_button.scss`, lines 427–440):
```scss
@keyframes no-corner-btn-highlight-sweep {
  0%, 28% {
    background-position: 0 0, -140% 0;
  }
  72%, 100% {
    background-position: 0 0, 240% 0;
  }
}
```
Used on `.no-corner-btn--highlight` with 2.8s animation.

---

### 4. **Key Animation Variables & Utilities**

From `base/_root.scss` (assumed from usage):
- `--transition-slow` — used for block-reveal
- `--transition-default` — default state transitions
- `--duration-default` — modal/button timings
- `--ease-default`, `--modal-enter-ease`, `--ease-smooth`
- `--block-reveal-offset-y` — translateY offset (implied ~24px)
- `--block-reveal-blur` — blur filter value (implied ~4-8px)

**fluid() helper** — used throughout for responsive sizing:
```scss
padding: fluid(24, 36);   // min 24px → max 36px scaled fluidly
width: fluid(220, 320);   // min 220px → max 320px
```

**mq() helper** — breakpoint mixin:
```scss
@include mq(md) { ... }   // medium breakpoint
@include mq(sm) { ... }   // small breakpoint
```

---

### 5. **No Existing Pin/Scroll Animation Patterns**

**Important finding:** The SCSS contains **no existing pin or ScrollTrigger-like patterns**. 

- Gallery and Proof sections are **canvas-only**, fully JavaScript-rendered
- Text reveals use simple **opacity/transform/blur** transitions triggered by scroll classes (`.is-block-reveal-up`)
- No `position: sticky`, no `will-change: transform` for pinning, no GSAP ScrollTrigger CSS bridges

The JavaScript (not shown) likely controls:
- When to apply `.is-block-reveal-up` state
- Canvas rendering timing/animation
- Scroll detection for `data-scene` attributes

---

## Summary Table

| Feature | Location | Pattern |
|---------|----------|---------|
| **8 Main Sections** | `index.php` lines 88–420 | `.no-sub-about-section` + `data-scene` + `aria-hidden` |
| **Gallery Canvas** | `_sub.scss` lines 466–486 | Wrapper only, JS-rendered |
| **Proof Canvas** | `_sub.scss` lines 488–502 | Wrapper only, JS-rendered |
| **Block Reveal** | `_utils.scss` lines 191–237 | `.is-block-reveal` → `.is-block-reveal-up` opacity/transform/blur |
| **Modal Animations** | `_modal.scss` lines 55–60 | Scale + translateY + blur on enter/exit |
| **Button Highlight** | `_button.scss` lines 427–440 | 2.8s sweep animation on `--highlight` variant |
| **Responsive Sizing** | Throughout | `fluid(min, max)` helper |
| **Breakpoints** | Throughout | `@include mq(md/sm/lg)` helper |

All files are at:
- **HTML:** c:\Users\edn_y\renew_nineonelabs\views\pages\about\index.php
- **Main SCSS:** c:\Users\edn_y\renew_nineonelabs\resource\scss\pages\_sub.scss
- **Utilities:** c:\Users\edn_y\renew_nineonelabs\resource\scss\base\_utils.scss
- **Components:** c:\Users\edn_y\renew_nineonelabs\resource\scss\components\_modal.scss, _button.scss

