      <h2 class="no-sub-about-proof__headline f-display-1 is-block-reveal">
        <span class="mask-target">수많은 작업으로 증명해왔고,<br>앞으로도 그럴 것이다.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="no-sub-about-proof__canvas-wrap">
      <canvas id="about-proof-canvas"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
```

---

## 2. SCSS (`resource/scss/pages/_sub.scss`)

기존 `&-gallery` / `&-proof` 블록(line 466–502) 전체 교체.

### Gallery
```scss
