## 3. TypeScript 타입 (`resource/ts/types/about.types.ts`)

`AboutSceneSectionKey` (line 99–106)에 두 키 추가:
```typescript
export type AboutSceneSectionKey =
  | "heroIntro"
  | "heroSlogan"
  | "gallery"      // 추가
  | "proof"        // 추가
  | "missionVision"
  | "services"
  | "awards"
  | "client"
  | "contact";
```

`AboutTheatreSheetId`는 변경 없음 — gallery/proof는 Theatre 3D 카메라 씬 없이 DOM-only reveal만 사용.

---

## 4. Scene Config (`resource/ts/pages/about/scene/about.scene.ts`)

### 4-a. DOM 상태 + reveal 헬퍼 추가

```typescript
const GALLERY_TEXT_SELECTOR = '.no-sub-about-gallery .is-block-reveal';
const PROOF_TEXT_SELECTOR = '.no-sub-about-proof .is-block-reveal';
const SECTION_TEXT_REVEAL_THRESHOLD = 0.18;
const SECTION_TEXT_HIDE_THRESHOLD = 0.08;
const SECTION_TEXT_STAGGER_MS = 150;

const aboutGalleryDomState = { visible: false, timers: [] as number[] };
const aboutProofDomState = { visible: false, timers: [] as number[] };

function syncSectionTextReveal(
  selector: string,
  domState: { visible: boolean; timers: number[] },
  progress: number,
): void {
  const shouldShow = progress >= SECTION_TEXT_REVEAL_THRESHOLD;
  const shouldHide = !shouldShow && progress < SECTION_TEXT_HIDE_THRESHOLD;
  if (!shouldShow && !shouldHide) return;
  if (domState.visible === shouldShow) return;
  domState.visible = shouldShow;
  domState.timers.forEach((id) => window.clearTimeout(id));
  domState.timers = [];

  const elements = Array.from(
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(selector)
  );
  elements.forEach((el, i) => {
    const id = window.setTimeout(() => {
      el.classList.toggle('is-block-reveal-up', shouldShow);
    }, i * SECTION_TEXT_STAGGER_MS);
    domState.timers.push(id);
  });
}

function disposeSectionTextReveal(
  selector: string,
  domState: { visible: boolean; timers: number[] },
): void {
  domState.timers.forEach((id) => window.clearTimeout(id));
  domState.timers = [];
  domState.visible = false;
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(selector).forEach((el) =>
    el.classList.remove('is-block-reveal-up')
  );
}
```

### 4-b. 스크롤 씬 셀렉터/옵션/background 추가

```typescript
// ABOUT_SCROLL_SCENE_SELECTORS에 추가:
gallery: '.no-sub-about-gallery[data-scene="gallery"]',
proof: '.no-sub-about-proof[data-scene="proof"]',

// ABOUT_SCROLL_SCENE_OPTIONS에 추가:
gallery: {
  ...ABOUT_TOP_ANCHORED_SCENE_OPTION,
  scrollSpanVh: 200,
  progressLagMs: 280,
  progressStart: 0.04,
  progressEnd: 0.96,
  progressPower: 1.04,
},
proof: {
  ...ABOUT_TOP_ANCHORED_SCENE_OPTION,
  scrollSpanVh: 200,
  progressLagMs: 280,
  progressStart: 0.04,
  progressEnd: 0.96,
  progressPower: 1.04,
},

// ABOUT_BACKGROUND_STATES_BY_SCENE_KEY에 추가:
gallery: { variant: "aboutHeroSlogan" },
proof: { variant: "aboutHeroSlogan" },
```

### 4-c. scenes 객체에 추가

```typescript
gallery: {
  onProgress: (progress: number): void => {
    syncSectionTextReveal(GALLERY_TEXT_SELECTOR, aboutGalleryDomState, progress);
  },
  onDispose: (): void => {
    disposeSectionTextReveal(GALLERY_TEXT_SELECTOR, aboutGalleryDomState);
  },
},
proof: {
  onProgress: (progress: number, proofRenderer?: AboutProofRenderer): void => {
    syncSectionTextReveal(PROOF_TEXT_SELECTOR, aboutProofDomState, progress);
    // proofRenderer는 AboutPageRuntime에서 주입 (아래 5번 방식으로 연동)
  },
  onDispose: (): void => {
    disposeSectionTextReveal(PROOF_TEXT_SELECTOR, aboutProofDomState);
  },
},
```

> **Note**: `AboutProofRenderer.setScrollProgress()` 연동은 `AboutPageRuntime`에서 scroll progress 콜백을 구독하는 방식으로 처리 — scene config가 renderer 인스턴스를 직접 받지 않도록 의존성 분리.

---

## 5. AboutProofRenderer 강화 (`resource/ts/pages/about/render/AboutProofRenderer.ts`)

### `setScrollProgress(p: number)` 메서드 추가

스크롤 progress(0–1)를 받아 카메라 위치와 회전 속도를 드라이브:

```typescript
private _scrollProgress = 0;

setScrollProgress(progress: number): void {
  this._scrollProgress = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, progress));
}
```

### `_tick` 렌더 루프 수정

```typescript
private readonly _tick = (): void => {
  if (this._disposed || !this._rendering) return;
  const p = this._scrollProgress;
  // 회전 속도: 0.0005 → 0.0014 (progress 따라 가속)
  const speed = ROTATION_SPEED_Y * (1 + p * 1.8);
  if (this._group) this._group.rotation.y += speed;
  // 카메라 위치: Y 3→0, Z 22→16 (zoom+tilt)
  if (this._camera) {
    this._camera.position.y = 3 - p * 3;
    this._camera.position.z = 22 - p * 6;
    this._camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);
  }
  if (this._renderer && this._scene && this._camera) {
    this._renderer.render(this._scene, this._camera);
  }
  this._rafId = requestAnimationFrame(this._tick);
};
```

### AboutPageRuntime에서 proof scroll progress 연동

`AboutPageRuntime.ts`에서 proof 씬 progress를 `_proofRenderer.setScrollProgress()`로 연결.
`AppManager`가 노출하는 scroll progress 콜백 또는 `ScrollSceneRuntime` 이벤트를 구독해서 처리.
(구체적 연동 방식은 `AppManager`의 public API에 맞게 조정)

---

## 검증 방법

1. `rtk tsc --noEmit` — 타입 에러 없음 확인 (특히 `AboutSceneSectionKey` 확장 후 `Record<AboutSceneSectionKey, ...>` 사용처)
2. 브라우저 `http://localhost:8888/about` 에서:
   - Gallery 섹션 진입 시 섹션이 핀되고 텍스트가 reveal됨
   - Proof 섹션 진입 시 동일 reveal + 카메라가 zoom/tilt되며 회전 가속
   - 섹션 벗어나면 텍스트 숨김 (dispose 콜백)
3. `rtk npm run test` — 기존 테스트 통과 확인

